# Facts about Professor Aldric Thorne.

@fact thorne.storm
tier: surface
text: Rumoured to have once out-duelled a storm.

@fact thorne.lost
tier: personal
unlock: seen(thorne_storm_story) > 0
text: He lost to the storm, badly. Losing well, he says, is the only thing worth teaching.

@fact thorne.roses
tier: secret
unlock: seen(thorne_roses) > 0
text: He tends a tiny walled rose garden behind the observatory at dawn and talks to the roses.

@fact thorne.hands
tier: secret
unlock: seen(thorne_shaking_hands) > 0
text: His hands have started to shake. Age comes for every storm eventually.

@fact thorne.rival
tier: personal
unlock: seen(thorne_old_rival) > 0
text: A flamboyant old wizard in purple has wanted a rematch with him for forty years.

@fact thorne.letters
tier: personal
unlock: rel(thorne) >= 30
text: He writes very few letters of recommendation, and the Conclave reads every one.
